WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.649
It's been seven hours and 15 days

00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:20.045
Since you took your love away

00:00:24.631 --> 00:00:30.765
I go out every night and sleep all day

00:00:32.481 --> 00:00:35.811
Since you took your love away

00:00:41.077 --> 00:00:47.757
Since you been gone, I can do whatever I want

00:00:48.231 --> 00:00:51.789
I can see whomever I choose

00:00:56.638 --> 00:01:05.194
I can eat my dinner in a fancy restaurant
But nothing

00:01:05.194 --> 00:01:11.782
I said nothing can take away these blues

00:01:11.782 --> 00:01:16.682
'Cause nothing compares

00:01:16.682 --> 00:01:25.691
Nothing compares to you

